                    <li data-value="{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fig8&quot;,&quot;images&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;fig8_0&quot;,&quot;imageUris&quot;:[&quot;/view/journals/atsc/83/9/full-JAS-D-26-0015.1-f8.jpg&quot;],&quot;header&quot;:&quot;&lt;sc&gt;Fig&lt;\/sc&gt;. 8.&quot;,&quot;footer&quot;:&quot;&lt;caption encoding-type=\&quot;nlm\&quot; ifp-element-xpath=\&quot;/*[local-name() = 'figure' and namespace-uri() = 'http://www.ifactory.com/press']/*[local-name() = 'caption' and namespace-uri() = 'http://www.ifactory.com/press']\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(a) The vertically integrated EAPE tendency (&lt;i&gt;DA&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;/&lt;i&gt;Dt&lt;\/i&gt;; black bar; left &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis) derived from EAPE budget [Eq. &lt;a href=\&quot;#E16\&quot; id=\&quot;ref_E16\&quot;&gt;(16)&lt;\/a&gt;], consisting of EAPE generation [&lt;i&gt;G&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); red bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], EAPE conversion from background flow [&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;I&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); yellow bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], baroclinic energy conversion from EKE to EAPE [−&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); green bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], EAPE advection [&lt;i&gt;A&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); blue bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], and residual (pink bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis). (b) As in (a), but for the EKE tendency (&lt;i&gt;DK&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;/&lt;i&gt;Dt&lt;\/i&gt;; black bar) derived from EKE budget [Eq. &lt;a href=\&quot;#E15\&quot; id=\&quot;ref_E15\&quot;&gt;(15)&lt;\/a&gt;], consisting of boundary flux [&lt;i&gt;B&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); red bar], dissipation [&lt;i&gt;D&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); orange bar], EKE conversion from background flow [&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;I&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); yellow bar], baroclinic energy conversion from EAPE to EKE [&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); green bar], EKE advection [&lt;i&gt;A&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); blue bar], and residual (pink bar). All values are averaged within a 500-km radius around the TC center. Solid bars and hatched bars indicate TC and ET phases, respectively. Note that the ranges of the left and right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axes differ.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/caption&gt;&quot;,&quot;altText&quot;:&quot;&lt;caption encoding-type=\&quot;nlm\&quot; ifp-element-xpath=\&quot;/*[local-name() = 'figure' and namespace-uri() = 'http://www.ifactory.com/press']/*[local-name() = 'caption' and namespace-uri() = 'http://www.ifactory.com/press']\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;(a) The vertically integrated EAPE tendency (&lt;i&gt;DA&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;/&lt;i&gt;Dt&lt;\/i&gt;; black bar; left &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis) derived from EAPE budget [Eq. &lt;a href=\&quot;#E16\&quot; id=\&quot;ref_E16\&quot;&gt;(16)&lt;\/a&gt;], consisting of EAPE generation [&lt;i&gt;G&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); red bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], EAPE conversion from background flow [&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;I&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); yellow bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], baroclinic energy conversion from EKE to EAPE [−&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); green bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], EAPE advection [&lt;i&gt;A&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); blue bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis], and residual (pink bar; right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axis). (b) As in (a), but for the EKE tendency (&lt;i&gt;DK&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;/&lt;i&gt;Dt&lt;\/i&gt;; black bar) derived from EKE budget [Eq. &lt;a href=\&quot;#E15\&quot; id=\&quot;ref_E15\&quot;&gt;(15)&lt;\/a&gt;], consisting of boundary flux [&lt;i&gt;B&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); red bar], dissipation [&lt;i&gt;D&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); orange bar], EKE conversion from background flow [&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;I&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); yellow bar], baroclinic energy conversion from EAPE to EKE [&lt;i&gt;C&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;A&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); green bar], EKE advection [&lt;i&gt;A&lt;\/i&gt;(&lt;i&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;E&lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/i&gt;); blue bar], and residual (pink bar). All values are averaged within a 500-km radius around the TC center. Solid bars and hatched bars indicate TC and ET phases, respectively. Note that the ranges of the left and right &lt;i&gt;y&lt;\/i&gt; axes differ.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;\/caption&gt;&quot;,&quot;watermarkPath&quot;:&quot;AMS-Logo-Lockup-Journals-01.pngAMS-Logo-Lockup-Journals-01.png&quot;,&quot;currentUri&quot;:&quot;/journals/atsc/83/9/JAS-D-26-0015.1.xml&quot;}]}" aria-selected="false" role="option" data-menu-item="list-id-85e03ebf-6f15-4ce1-a28f-ec2054844a2e" class="ListItem ListItem--disableGutters ListItem--divider">
