                        </span>

                        <span class="caption text-caption color-text-primary">
                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 2.</b>
                            
<p>Satellite images (10.5-<i>μ</i>m infrared channel) obtained from GK2A at (a) 1100 UTC 9 Oct, (b) 0400 UTC 10 Oct, (c) 1800 UTC 10 Oct, (d) 0900 UTC 11 Oct, (e) 2100 UTC 11 Oct, and (f) 0500 UTC 12 Oct 2019.</p>
                            
                        </span>


                    </div>
                
            
                
                    <div class="figure splide__slide has-caption">

