                        </ul>

                        <span class="primary-img" style="background:url(/view/journals/atsc/83/9/full-JAS-D-26-0015.1-f5.jpg)">
                           <!-- <img src="${var:currentFullImageUri}" /> -->
                        </span>

                        <span class="caption text-caption color-text-primary">
                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 5.</b>
                            
<p>(a),(c),(e),(g) As in <a id="ref_fig4" href="#fig4">Fig. 4</a>, but for 250-hPa horizontal wind speed (shading; m s<sup>−1</sup>) and 500-hPa omega (blue contours; for negative values with a 0.2 Pa s<sup>−1</sup> interval). (b),(d),(f),(h) As in (a), (c), (e), and (g), but for the latitude–pressure cross sections along the TC center for horizontal wind speed (shading; m s<sup>−1</sup>), omega (blue contours; for negative values with a 0.2 Pa s<sup>−1</sup> interval), and meridional–vertical wind (vectors; <i>ω</i> is multiplied by an aspect ratio of −21.46).</p>
                            
                        </span>


