                        <span class="caption text-caption color-text-primary">
                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 6.</b>
                            
<p>Storm-relative distributions of vertically integrated (a),(c),(e) EAPE (<i>A<sub>E</sub></i>) and (b),(d),(f) EKE (<i>K<sub>E</sub></i>) at (a),(b) 1200 UTC 11 Oct 2019 (TC stage), (c),(d) 0600 UTC 12 Oct 2019 (ET stage), and (e),(f) 0000 UTC 13 Oct 2019 (ETC stage). The black circle denotes a 500-km radius from the TC center.</p>
                            
                        </span>


