                           <!-- <img src="${var:currentFullImageUri}" /> -->
                        </span>

                        <span class="caption text-caption color-text-primary">
                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 7.</b>
                            
<p>Time series of vertically integrated total eddy energy (<i>A<sub>E</sub></i> + <i>K<sub>E</sub></i>; gray line), EAPE (<i>A<sub>E</sub></i>; blue line), and EKE (<i>K<sub>E</sub></i>; green line) for TC Hagibis (2019), averaged within a 500-km radius around the TC center. Dashed gray lines denote the onset and completion of ET as defined by the CPS diagram. Green and blue shadings indicate the TC and ET phases, respectively.</p>
                            
                        </span>


                    </div>
                
            
                
                    <div class="figure splide__slide has-caption">

