                           <!-- <img src="${var:currentFullImageUri}" /> -->
                        </span>

                        <span class="caption text-caption color-text-primary">
                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 9.</b>
                            
<p>Storm-relative composites of vertically integrated (a),(e) <i>G</i>(<i>A<sub>E</sub></i>), (b),(f) <i>C</i>(<i>A<sub>I</sub></i>, <i>A<sub>E</sub></i>), (c),(g) <i>C</i>(<i>A<sub>E</sub></i>, <i>K<sub>E</sub></i>), and (d),(h) <i>B</i>(<i>K<sub>E</sub></i>) during (a)–(d) TC phase and (e)–(h) ET phase. The black circle denotes a 500-km radius from the TC center.</p>
                            
                        </span>


                    </div>
                
            
                
                    <div class="figure splide__slide has-caption">

                      <ul class="actions color-primary">
                            <li><a target="_blank" href="/view/journals/atsc/83/9/full-JAS-D-26-0015.1-f10.jpg" class="ico-image-file"><span>View raw image</span></a></li>
<!--                            <li><a class="ico-powerpoint" href="#"><span><t:region key="view.image-gallery.download-powerpoint-text">Download Powerpoint Slide</t:region></span></a></li> -->

