                        </span>

                        <span class="caption text-caption color-text-primary">
                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 10.</b>
                            
<p>As in <a id="ref_fig9" href="#fig9">Fig. 9</a>, but for vertically integrated (a),(d) <i>G</i>(<i>A<sub>E</sub></i>) (W m<sup>−2</sup>), (b),(e) vertically averaged diabatic heating rate anomaly [K (6 h)<sup>−1</sup>], and (c),(f) vertically averaged temperature anomaly (K).</p>
                            
                        </span>


