                        <span class="caption text-caption color-text-primary">
                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 15.</b>
                            
<p>Temporal evolution of EKE tendency (<i>DK<sub>E</sub></i>/<i>Dt</i>) and EAPE tendency (<i>DA<sub>E</sub></i>/<i>Dt</i>) for TC Hagibis (2019). Red, orange, green, and blue dots indicate the beginning of the cyclone life cycle as a tropical storm, ET onset, ET completion, and the end of the JMA best track record, respectively. The green line and the blue line indicate the TC and ET phases, respectively.</p>
                            
