                            <b><sc>Fig</sc>. 16.</b>
                            
<p>As in <a id="ref_fig1" href="#fig1">Fig. 1</a>, but for the (top) TC phase and (bottom) ET phase of TC Hagibis (2019). The value inside each box represents the tendency of local eddy energy (W m<sup>−2</sup>), while the arrows denote the energy budget terms (W m<sup>−2</sup>). Blue arrows indicate the main energy pathways, while thick blue arrows highlight the enhanced energy processes during the ET phase compared to the TC phase.</p>
                            
