    		<h2 class="itemTitle item-title content-title text-headline mb-2">
    			<a target="_self" href="/view/journals/apme/65/1/JAMC-D-24-0233.1.xml" class="c-Button--link">Evaluating the Utility of NDVI as a Damage Indicator for Crops in the Enhanced Fujita Scale</a>
    			
